   "en": "God-level Assassin, I’m the Shadow"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "网游：神级刺客，我即是暗影"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where people sleep and enter the realm abandoned by God, Qin Feng, who had sacrificed everything for his sister, is betrayed by her.\nHowever, fate grants him a second chance, sending him back nine years before the abandoned world appears.\nThis time, Qin Feng chooses to abandon his sister and focus on becoming the strongest.\n\n(Source: MangaUpdates)"
